{"deletions":[],"marks":[],"ops":[{"after":0,"anchor":"rfc-proxy-ip-tokenbucket-v2去除-terminal_id-信任边界","cjk":true,"html":"<h1 id=\"rfc-proxy-ip-tokenbucket-v2去除-terminal_id-信任边界\">RFC: Proxy IP TokenBucket v2（去除 terminal_id 信任边界）</h1>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":1},{"after":1,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>状态: Draft（增量修订）<br>目标文件: <code>.legion/tasks/vendor-tokenbucket-proxy-ip/docs/rfc.md</code><br>日期: 2026-03-21<br>风险分级: Medium</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":2},{"after":2,"anchor":"摘要--动机","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"摘要--动机\">摘要 / 动机</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":3},{"after":3,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>本次修订收敛 HTTPProxy 的信任模型：<code>terminal_id</code> 不再被视为稳定身份，也不得再作为 HTTPProxy 白名单或路由 pin 的依据。同一 host 网络中可见的 <code>HTTPProxy</code> terminal 默认互信；请求仅按 <code>labels.ip</code> 选择出口，token bucket 也仅按 <code>encodePath([baseKey, ip])</code> 隔离。</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":4},{"after":4,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>动机有三点：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":5},{"after":5,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-first\" start=\"1\"><li><code>terminal_id</code> 不稳定，继续把它当作 trust boundary 会导致配置漂移、误拒绝、回滚复杂度升高。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":6},{"after":6,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block\" start=\"2\"><li>当前限流与实际出口已经以 <code>ip</code> 为核心维度；继续把 <code>terminal_id</code> 混入 helper 返回值和请求标签，只会制造“同一出口、不同身份”的伪差异。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":7},{"after":7,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-last\" start=\"3\"><li>用户最新要求已经明确：同一 host 网络内所有 terminal 默认互信，因此信任边界应上移到 host 网络/接入面，而不是终端自报的 <code>terminal_id</code>。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":8},{"after":8,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>结论：本 RFC 将 v2 方案改为“host 内默认互信 + IP 维度选路/限流”，并显式删除 <code>TRUSTED_HTTP_PROXY_TERMINAL_IDS</code> 相关设计与实现。</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":9},{"after":9,"anchor":"目标与非目标","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"目标与非目标\">目标与非目标</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":10},{"after":10,"anchor":"目标","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"目标\">目标</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":11},{"after":11,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li>代理模式下，helper MUST 仅基于同 host 网络中可见的 <code>HTTPProxy</code> 服务、合法 <code>tags.ip</code>、可信 <code>ip_source</code> 生成候选池。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":12},{"after":12,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>helper MUST 不再读取、解析、缓存或依赖 <code>TRUSTED_HTTP_PROXY_TERMINAL_IDS</code>。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":13},{"after":13,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>libraries/http-services/src/proxy-ip.ts</code> 内所有导出的 HTTPProxy 候选枚举/选择 helper MUST 统一复用同一个“host 内默认互信 + 合法 <code>ip</code> + <code>ip_source=http-services</code> + IP 去重”候选构造逻辑。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":14},{"after":14,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>helper 返回值 MUST 从 <code>{ ip, terminalId, bucketKey }</code> 收敛为 <code>{ ip, bucketKey }</code>。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":15},{"after":15,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>vendor 请求路由 MUST 只写入 <code>labels.ip</code>，MUST NOT 再写入 <code>labels.terminal_id</code>。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":16},{"after":16,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>apps/http-proxy</code> 服务注册 MUST 删除 <code>labels.terminal_id</code>；不得继续暴露 terminal 级 route pin 能力。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":17},{"after":17,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>同一 host 网络内多个 terminal 共享同一出口 IP 时，MUST 视为同一个限流/路由等价类。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":18},{"after":18,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li>RFC 必须明确回答：后续不应继续在请求 <code>labels</code> 或 helper 返回值中使用 <code>terminal_id</code> 充当 trust boundary 或稳定身份。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":19},{"after":19,"anchor":"非目标","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"非目标\">非目标</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":20},{"after":20,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li>不修改 <code>tokenBucket</code> 底层算法、<code>acquireSync</code> 语义和 semaphore 实现。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":21},{"after":21,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>不改造协议层 <code>terminal_id</code> 作为消息寻址字段的既有职责。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":22},{"after":22,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>不在本次 scope 内引入新的 host 级鉴权、mTLS 或网络分区机制。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":23},{"after":23,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li>不扩大到所有 vendor 的立即实现；本次落地范围仍以 <code>http-services</code>、<code>http-proxy</code>、<code>vendor-binance</code> 为主。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":24},{"after":24,"anchor":"定义","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"定义\">定义</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":25},{"after":25,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li><code>Host 网络</code>: 同一个 Terminal Host 视图内可见、可被当前 terminal 枚举到的终端集合。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":26},{"after":26,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>HTTPProxy 候选</code>: 同 host 网络内声明了 <code>HTTPProxy</code> 服务，且 <code>tags.ip</code> 为合法 IP、<code>tags.ip_source === &#39;http-services&#39;</code> 的 terminal。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":27},{"after":27,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>IP 等价类</code>: 具有相同 <code>tags.ip</code> 的一个或多个 <code>HTTPProxy</code> terminal；调度和限流只看 IP，不区分 terminal。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":28},{"after":28,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>BaseKey</code>: vendor 现有的限流基键。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":29},{"after":29,"cjk":false,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>BucketKey</code>: <code>encodePath([baseKey, ip])</code>。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":30},{"after":30,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li><code>Stage</code>: 错误归属阶段，取值 <code>{pool|acquire|route|request}</code>。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":31},{"after":31,"anchor":"现状与问题","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"现状与问题\">现状与问题</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":32},{"after":32,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>基于当前代码与任务上下文，可确认以下现状：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":33},{"after":33,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-first\" start=\"1\"><li><code>libraries/http-services/src/proxy-ip.ts</code> 通过 <code>TRUSTED_HTTP_PROXY_TERMINAL_IDS</code> 过滤候选 terminal，并把 <code>terminalId</code> 放入 <code>AcquireProxyBucketResult</code>。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":34},{"after":34,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block\" start=\"2\"><li><code>apps/http-proxy/src/index.ts</code> 会把 <code>labels.terminal_id = terminal.terminal_id</code> 注册到服务标签中。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":35},{"after":35,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-last\" start=\"3\"><li><code>apps/vendor-binance/src/api/client.ts</code> 在代理模式下把 <code>{ ip, terminal_id }</code> 一起写入请求 <code>labels</code>，等价于用 <code>terminal_id</code> 对相同 IP 的多个代理做二次 pin。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":36},{"after":36,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>这三处共同构成了当前错误的身份模型：虽然 bucket 已经按 IP 维度工作，但信任准入和路由仍被 <code>terminal_id</code> 绑住，导致 <code>terminal_id</code> 被误当成稳定身份与 trust boundary。</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":37},{"after":37,"anchor":"拟议设计","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"拟议设计\">拟议设计</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":38},{"after":38,"anchor":"1-信任模型","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"1-信任模型\">1. 信任模型</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":39},{"after":39,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li>同一 host 网络中的所有 terminal 默认互信。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":40},{"after":40,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>terminal_id</code> 不再参与 HTTPProxy 候选准入。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":41},{"after":41,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li>HTTPProxy 候选的最小准入条件收敛为：\n<ul><li>提供 <code>HTTPProxy</code> 服务；</li><li><code>tags.ip</code> 为合法 IP；</li><li><code>tags.ip_source === &#39;http-services&#39;</code>。</li></ul></li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":42},{"after":42,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>这意味着 trust boundary 从“terminal allowlist”上移为“是否已经进入同一个 host 网络并暴露合法 HTTPProxy 服务”。如果未来需要更细粒度隔离，应在 host 接入层做，而不是恢复 <code>terminal_id</code> 白名单。</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":43},{"after":43,"anchor":"2-候选池与去重","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"2-候选池与去重\">2. 候选池与去重</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":44},{"after":44,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li>helper 从 <code>terminal.terminalInfos</code> 枚举全部 <code>HTTPProxy</code> terminal。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":45},{"after":45,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>先过滤非法 IP、缺失 <code>ip_source</code>、非 <code>HTTPProxy</code> 服务。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":46},{"after":46,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>再按 <code>ip</code> 去重，得到 <code>IPPool</code>。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":47},{"after":47,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>同一 IP 对应多个 terminal 时，helper 只保留一个 IP 候选；不对外暴露 terminal 级身份。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":48},{"after":48,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li><code>listHTTPProxyIps</code>、<code>waitForHTTPProxyIps</code>、<code>selectHTTPProxyIpRoundRobin</code>、<code>selectHTTPProxyIpRoundRobinAsync</code>、<code>acquireProxyBucket</code> 等导出 helper MUST 统一复用这一候选构造逻辑，避免一部分链路去掉 allowlist、另一部分链路仍保留旧 env/cache/log 分支。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":49},{"after":49,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>理由：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":50},{"after":50,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li>token bucket 已按 IP 维度隔离；</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":51},{"after":51,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>请求路由也只需 <code>labels.ip</code>；</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":52},{"after":52,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li>同一 host 网络内多个 terminal 共享同一出口 IP 时，额外携带 <code>terminal_id</code> 只会制造不必要的路由 pin 和身份耦合。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":53},{"after":53,"anchor":"3-调度与请求流程","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"3-调度与请求流程\">3. 调度与请求流程</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":54},{"after":54,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>端到端流程如下：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":55},{"after":55,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-first\" start=\"1\"><li>vendor 计算 <code>baseKey</code> 与 <code>weight</code>，传入 <code>getBucketOptions(baseKey)</code>。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":56},{"after":56,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block\" start=\"2\"><li>helper 枚举同 host 网络内全部 <code>HTTPProxy</code> 候选，并按 IP 去重得到 <code>IPPool</code>。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":57},{"after":57,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block\" start=\"3\"><li>helper 维持现有“可承载组优先”策略：优先尝试 <code>read() &gt;= weight</code> 的 IP，再尝试其余 IP。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":58},{"after":58,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block\" start=\"4\"><li>对每个 IP 候选执行 <code>acquireSync(weight)</code>；成功即返回 <code>{ ip, bucketKey }</code>。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":59},{"after":59,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block\" start=\"5\"><li>vendor 将返回的 <code>ip</code> 写入 <code>fetch.labels.ip</code>，不再写入 <code>labels.terminal_id</code>。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":60},{"after":60,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-last\" start=\"6\"><li><code>fetch</code> 依赖协议层现有 schema 匹配能力，按 <code>labels.ip</code> 路由到任一满足该 IP 标签的 <code>HTTPProxy</code> 服务。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":61},{"after":61,"anchor":"4-接口收敛","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"4-接口收敛\">4. 接口收敛</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":62},{"after":62,"cjk":true,"html":"<p><code>AcquireProxyBucketResult</code> 调整为：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":63},{"after":63,"cjk":false,"html":"<div class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre><code>type AcquireProxyBucketResult = {\n  ip: string;\n  bucketKey: string;\n};</code></pre></div>","kind":"code","op":"insert","slot":64},{"after":64,"cjk":true,"html":"<p><code>IRequestContext</code> 在代理模式下调整为：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":65},{"after":65,"cjk":false,"html":"<div class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre><code>type IRequestContext = {\n  ip: string;\n  bucketKey: string;\n  acquireWeight: number;\n};</code></pre></div>","kind":"code","op":"insert","slot":66},{"after":66,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>请求标签调整为：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":67},{"after":67,"cjk":false,"html":"<div class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre><code>labels: {\n  ip: proxyIp;\n}</code></pre></div>","kind":"code","op":"insert","slot":68},{"after":68,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>明确回答：后续不应继续在 helper 返回值或请求 <code>labels</code> 中使用 <code>terminal_id</code> 作为 trust boundary、稳定身份或路由 pin；若保留 <code>terminal_id</code>，只能用于日志、指标、诊断上下文，且不得影响授权、候选筛选或目标选择。</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":69},{"after":69,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>额外 gate：<code>AcquireProxyBucketResult</code>、<code>IRequestContext</code> 与 <code>libraries/http-services/etc/http-services.api.md</code> 对 <code>terminalId</code> 的删除 MUST 同次落地、同次验证，禁止出现实现已删但类型/导出面残留，或类型已改但消费方未收敛的半改状态。</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":70},{"after":70,"anchor":"5-appshttp-proxy-标签契约","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"5-appshttp-proxy-标签契约\">5. <code>apps/http-proxy</code> 标签契约</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":71},{"after":71,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li>保留 <code>labels.ip</code>，因为它是路由键。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":72},{"after":72,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>删除 <code>labels.terminal_id</code>，因为它不再承担任何必须语义。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":73},{"after":73,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li><code>labels.hostname</code> 可保留，仅作为观测维度，不参与信任决策。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":74},{"after":74,"anchor":"6-关于同-ip-多-terminal-的行为","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"6-关于同-ip-多-terminal-的行为\">6. 关于同 IP 多 terminal 的行为</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":75},{"after":75,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li>同一 IP 下多个 <code>HTTPProxy</code> terminal 默认互信。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":76},{"after":76,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>路由命中该 IP 时，允许由协议层随机命中任一匹配 terminal。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":77},{"after":77,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li>这不是不确定性 bug，而是新的显式约定：同 IP 代表同一个出口等价类，terminal 级别不是稳定身份。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":78},{"after":78,"anchor":"备选方案","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"备选方案\">备选方案</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":79},{"after":79,"anchor":"方案-a继续保留-trusted_http_proxy_terminal_ids","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"方案-a继续保留-trusted_http_proxy_terminal_ids\">方案 A：继续保留 <code>TRUSTED_HTTP_PROXY_TERMINAL_IDS</code></h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":80},{"after":80,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first li-last\"><li>放弃原因：与“<code>terminal_id</code> 不稳定”这一事实正面冲突；每次 terminal 重建/迁移都要更新白名单，运维成本和误配置风险过高。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":81},{"after":81,"anchor":"方案-b改用-terminal_id--ip-双因子","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"方案-b改用-terminal_id--ip-双因子\">方案 B：改用 <code>terminal_id + ip</code> 双因子</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":82},{"after":82,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first li-last\"><li>放弃原因：本质上仍把 <code>terminal_id</code> 当成稳定身份，只是把失败模式藏得更深；同时会继续污染 helper 返回值与请求标签。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":83},{"after":83,"anchor":"方案-c引入-host-级显式信任域配置","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"方案-c引入-host-级显式信任域配置\">方案 C：引入 host 级显式信任域配置</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":84},{"after":84,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first li-last\"><li>放弃原因：方向上比 terminal allowlist 正确，但超出本次 scope；当前用户已明确接受“同 host 网络默认互信”，无需在此 RFC 中扩成新系统。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":85},{"after":85,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>本次选择：直接采用“host 内默认互信 + IP 等价类”模型。</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":86},{"after":86,"anchor":"数据模型与接口","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"数据模型与接口\">数据模型与接口</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":87},{"after":87,"anchor":"acquireproxybucketinput","cjk":false,"html":"<h3 id=\"acquireproxybucketinput\"><code>AcquireProxyBucketInput</code></h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":88},{"after":88,"cjk":false,"html":"<div class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre><code>type AcquireProxyBucketInput = {\n  baseKey: string;\n  weight: number;\n  terminal: Terminal;\n  getBucketOptions: (baseKey: string) =&gt; TokenBucketOptions;\n};</code></pre></div>","kind":"code","op":"insert","slot":89},{"after":89,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>约束：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":90},{"after":90,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li><code>getBucketOptions</code> 仍是唯一 options 来源；本次修订不改变这一点。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":91},{"after":91,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>helper MUST NOT 引入隐式默认 options。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":92},{"after":92,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li>helper MUST NOT 读取任何 terminal allowlist 环境变量。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":93},{"after":93,"anchor":"acquireproxybucketresult","cjk":false,"html":"<h3 id=\"acquireproxybucketresult\"><code>AcquireProxyBucketResult</code></h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":94},{"after":94,"cjk":false,"html":"<div class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"ts\"><pre><code>type AcquireProxyBucketResult = {\n  ip: string;\n  bucketKey: string;\n};</code></pre></div>","kind":"code","op":"insert","slot":95},{"after":95,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>兼容策略：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":96},{"after":96,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li>删除 <code>terminalId</code> 字段，属于有意 API 收敛。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":97},{"after":97,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>所有消费方必须改为只依赖 <code>ip</code> 与 <code>bucketKey</code>。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":98},{"after":98,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li><code>http-services.api.md</code> 必须同步更新，避免导出面残留旧身份模型。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":99},{"after":99,"anchor":"appshttp-proxy-服务标签","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"appshttp-proxy-服务标签\"><code>apps/http-proxy</code> 服务标签</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":100},{"after":100,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li>MUST 包含 <code>ip</code>。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":101},{"after":101,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>MAY 包含 <code>hostname</code>。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":102},{"after":102,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li>MUST NOT 包含用于信任/路由 pin 的 <code>terminal_id</code>。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":103},{"after":103,"anchor":"错误语义","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"错误语义\">错误语义</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":104},{"after":104,"cjk":true,"html":"<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>stage</th><th>触发条件</th><th>错误码</th><th>恢复语义</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>pool</code></td><td>host 网络内无可用 <code>HTTPProxy</code> IP</td><td><code>E_PROXY_TARGET_NOT_FOUND</code></td><td>长退避重试</td></tr><tr><td><code>acquire</code></td><td>所有 IP 候选均无法 <code>acquireSync(weight)</code></td><td><code>E_PROXY_BUCKET_EXHAUSTED</code></td><td>短退避重试</td></tr><tr><td><code>acquire</code></td><td>同 <code>bucketKey</code> options 指纹冲突</td><td><code>E_BUCKET_OPTIONS_CONFLICT</code></td><td>修配置后重试</td></tr><tr><td><code>route</code></td><td>仅按 <code>labels.ip</code> 路由但无匹配服务</td><td><code>E_PROXY_TARGET_NOT_FOUND</code></td><td>长退避重试</td></tr><tr><td><code>request</code></td><td>已路由成功但代理请求失败/上游失败</td><td><code>E_PROXY_REQUEST_FAILED</code></td><td>按既有策略</td></tr></tbody></table></div>","kind":"table","op":"insert","slot":105},{"after":105,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>补充约束：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":106},{"after":106,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li><code>SEMAPHORE_INSUFFICIENT_PERMS</code> 仍映射为 acquire 阶段的可恢复失败。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":107},{"after":107,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li>删除 allowlist 后，<code>empty_pool</code> 不再包含“白名单为空”这一原因分支，只保留“当前 host 视图中无可用 proxy IP”。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":108},{"after":108,"anchor":"安全考虑","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"安全考虑\">安全考虑</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":109},{"after":109,"anchor":"结论","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"结论\">结论</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":110},{"after":110,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>风险分级为 Medium。</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":111},{"after":111,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>理由：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":112},{"after":112,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-first\" start=\"1\"><li>变更会扩大同 host 网络内默认可用的 proxy 范围，从“显式 allowlist”变为“host 内默认互信”。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":113},{"after":113,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block\" start=\"2\"><li>但实际 trust boundary 已由用户明确上移到 host 网络，本次只是让实现与该模型对齐；影响面主要集中在 <code>http-services</code>/<code>http-proxy</code>/<code>vendor-binance</code>。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":114},{"after":114,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-last\" start=\"3\"><li>现有安全控制仍保留两道最小约束：必须是 <code>HTTPProxy</code> 服务，且 <code>tags.ip</code>/<code>ip_source</code> 必须合法。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":115},{"after":115,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>安全要求：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":116},{"after":116,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li>MUST 校验 <code>tags.ip</code> 为合法 IP，非法值不得进入候选池。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":117},{"after":117,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>MUST 校验 <code>tags.ip_source === &#39;http-services&#39;</code>，避免把未注入或脏标签当作路由键。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":118},{"after":118,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>MUST 对 IP 候选按 <code>ip</code> 去重，避免通过 terminal fan-out 放大 bucket cardinality。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":119},{"after":119,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li>MUST NOT 以 <code>terminal_id</code> 作为授权、白名单、路由 pin 或稳定身份。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":120},{"after":120,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li>SHOULD 在文档中明确：若未来需要隔离不同代理租户，必须在 host 级接入面做隔离，而不是恢复 terminal allowlist。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":121},{"after":121,"anchor":"向后兼容发布与回滚","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"向后兼容发布与回滚\">向后兼容、发布与回滚</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":122},{"after":122,"anchor":"向后兼容","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"向后兼容\">向后兼容</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":123},{"after":123,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li><code>TRUSTED_HTTP_PROXY_TERMINAL_IDS</code> 从本次开始失效并从实现中删除。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":124},{"after":124,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>AcquireProxyBucketResult.terminalId</code> 删除，属于编译期可发现的不兼容变更。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":125},{"after":125,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li>代理请求不再发送 <code>labels.terminal_id</code>；只要 <code>HTTPProxy</code> 服务按 <code>labels.ip</code> 路由，行为即保持可用。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":126},{"after":126,"anchor":"发布步骤","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"发布步骤\">发布步骤</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":127},{"after":127,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-first\" start=\"1\"><li>先修改 <code>http-services</code>：删除 allowlist 与 <code>terminalId</code> 返回值，更新 API report 与单测。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":128},{"after":128,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block\" start=\"2\"><li>再修改 <code>apps/http-proxy</code>：移除服务标签中的 <code>terminal_id</code>。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":129},{"after":129,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-last\" start=\"3\"><li>最后修改 <code>apps/vendor-binance</code>：请求上下文与 <code>fetch.labels</code> 只保留 <code>ip</code>。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":130},{"after":130,"anchor":"回滚策略","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"回滚策略\">回滚策略</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":131},{"after":131,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li>若新逻辑出现异常，回滚到上一个 commit/版本；不再保留运行时开关恢复 terminal allowlist。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":132},{"after":132,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li>回滚判据：<code>E_PROXY_TARGET_NOT_FOUND</code> 异常升高且排查确认为 host 网络内标签/路由不一致，而非容量耗尽。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":133},{"after":133,"anchor":"验证计划","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"验证计划\">验证计划</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":134},{"after":134,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>关键行为到测试/验收的映射如下：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":135},{"after":135,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li><code>V1</code> 删除 allowlist 后，只要同 host 网络内存在合法 <code>HTTPProxy</code> + <code>ip_source=http-services</code> + 合法 <code>ip</code>，helper 就能拿到候选池。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":136},{"after":136,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>V2</code> <code>TRUSTED_HTTP_PROXY_TERMINAL_IDS</code> 即使设置，也不会影响候选结果。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":137},{"after":137,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>V3</code> helper 返回值不再包含 <code>terminalId</code>，API report 同步收敛。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":138},{"after":138,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>V4</code> vendor 代理请求只携带 <code>labels.ip</code>，不再携带 <code>labels.terminal_id</code>。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":139},{"after":139,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>V5</code> 同 IP 多 terminal 时，helper 只生成一个 <code>bucketKey</code>，不会因 terminal 数量放大 bucket。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":140},{"after":140,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>V6</code> 同 IP 多 terminal 时，请求只带 <code>labels.ip</code> 仍可成功路由到任一匹配代理。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":141},{"after":141,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>V7</code> 可承载组优先、失败切换、空池、全失败、options 冲突等旧 v2 行为保持不变。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":142},{"after":142,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li><code>V8</code> <code>apps/http-proxy</code> 不再注册 <code>labels.terminal_id</code>；若仅按 <code>labels.ip</code> 路由无匹配，错误必须落到 <code>stage=route</code> / <code>E_PROXY_TARGET_NOT_FOUND</code>。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":143},{"after":143,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>建议最小测试集合：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":144},{"after":144,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-first\" start=\"1\"><li><code>proxy-ip.test.ts</code>\n<ul><li>删除“allowlist 为空 fail-closed”断言。</li><li>新增“环境变量存在但被忽略”断言。</li><li>新增“同 IP 多 terminal 去重后只创建一个 bucket”断言。</li><li>新增“所有导出 helper 统一忽略 allowlist/env 分支”的等价覆盖。</li></ul></li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":145},{"after":145,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block\" start=\"2\"><li><code>client</code>/vendor 测试\n<ul><li>断言代理请求只传 <code>labels.ip</code>。</li><li>断言 <code>IRequestContext</code> 不再暴露 <code>terminalId</code>。</li><li>断言 <code>apps/http-proxy</code> 服务标签不再包含 <code>terminal_id</code>。</li><li>新增最小 route 验收：两个 <code>HTTPProxy</code> terminal 共享同一 IP 时，请求仅带 <code>labels.ip</code> 仍可成功；若 <code>labels.ip</code> 无匹配，则返回 <code>stage=route</code> / <code>E_PROXY_TARGET_NOT_FOUND</code>。</li></ul></li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":146},{"after":146,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-last\" start=\"3\"><li>构建验收\n<ul><li><code>libraries/http-services</code> 单测通过。</li><li><code>apps/vendor-binance</code> 构建通过。</li></ul></li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":147},{"after":147,"anchor":"开放问题","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"开放问题\">开放问题</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":148},{"after":148,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-first\" start=\"1\"><li>当前保留 <code>ip_source === &#39;http-services&#39;</code> 作为最小标签可信信号；若未来同样被证明不够稳定，需另起 RFC 讨论 host 级签名/鉴权方案。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":149},{"after":149,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-last\" start=\"2\"><li>同 IP 多 terminal 的随机命中是否需要额外 observability（如命中 terminal 分布）？本次不是阻塞项。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":150},{"after":150,"anchor":"落地计划","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"落地计划\">落地计划</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":151},{"after":151,"anchor":"文件变更点","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"文件变更点\">文件变更点</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":152},{"after":152,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li><code>libraries/http-services/src/proxy-ip.ts</code>\n<ul><li>删除 <code>TRUSTED_HTTP_PROXY_TERMINAL_IDS</code> 常量、缓存、解析与 allowlist 过滤。</li><li>将候选池逻辑改为“host 内全部 HTTPProxy terminal + IP 去重”，并抽成统一候选构造函数供全部导出 helper 复用。</li><li>删除 <code>AcquireProxyBucketResult.terminalId</code>。</li></ul></li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":153},{"after":153,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>libraries/http-services/src/client.ts</code>\n<ul><li>文档与接口注释更新为“路由依赖 <code>labels.ip</code>，不依赖 <code>labels.terminal_id</code>”。</li></ul></li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":154},{"after":154,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>libraries/http-services/src/index.ts</code>\n<ul><li>仅确认导出面与收敛后的类型一致。</li></ul></li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":155},{"after":155,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>libraries/http-services/src/__tests__/proxy-ip.test.ts</code>\n<ul><li>删除 allowlist 相关测试；补充“env 被忽略”“同 IP 去重”测试。</li></ul></li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":156},{"after":156,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>libraries/http-services/src/__tests__/client.test.ts</code>\n<ul><li>维持 route/request 错误阶段断言，并确认请求标签仅包含 <code>ip</code>。</li></ul></li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":157},{"after":157,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>libraries/http-services/src/__tests__/integration.test.ts</code>\n<ul><li>补充“同 IP 多 terminal 时仅按 <code>labels.ip</code> 仍可成功路由”的最小自动化验收。</li></ul></li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":158},{"after":158,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>libraries/http-services/etc/http-services.api.md</code>\n<ul><li>删除 <code>AcquireProxyBucketResult.terminalId</code>。</li></ul></li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":159},{"after":159,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block\"><li><code>apps/http-proxy/src/index.ts</code>\n<ul><li>删除 <code>labels.terminal_id</code> 注入，并把“服务标签仅保留 <code>ip</code>/<code>hostname</code> 观测维度”作为硬验收。</li></ul></li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":160},{"after":160,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li><code>apps/vendor-binance/src/api/client.ts</code>\n<ul><li>删除 <code>IRequestContext.terminalId</code>。</li><li>删除对 <code>AcquireProxyBucketResult.terminalId</code> 的消费。</li><li>代理请求标签只保留 <code>{ ip }</code>。</li></ul></li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":161},{"after":161,"anchor":"最小验证步骤","cjk":true,"html":"<h3 id=\"最小验证步骤\">最小验证步骤</h3>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":162},{"after":162,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-first\" start=\"1\"><li>跑 <code>libraries/http-services</code> 单测，确认去 allowlist 后候选池/去重/旧错误语义仍通过。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":163},{"after":163,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block\" start=\"2\"><li>跑 <code>apps/vendor-binance</code> 构建，确认类型收敛没有残留 <code>terminalId</code> 依赖。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":164},{"after":164,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block\" start=\"3\"><li>自动化验证：两个同 host 的 <code>HTTPProxy</code> terminal 共享同一 IP 时，请求只带 <code>labels.ip</code> 仍可成功；若无匹配，必须得到 <code>stage=route</code> / <code>E_PROXY_TARGET_NOT_FOUND</code>。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":165},{"after":165,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-last\" start=\"4\"><li>如有条件，再做一次本地 smoke：确认任一 terminal 可被路由命中且 bucketKey 仍只按 IP 维度变化。</li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":166},{"after":166,"anchor":"发现的类似-terminal_id-依赖与处置建议","cjk":true,"html":"<h2 id=\"发现的类似-terminal_id-依赖与处置建议\">发现的类似 <code>terminal_id</code> 依赖与处置建议</h2>","kind":"heading","op":"insert","slot":167},{"after":167,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>以下位置仍把 <code>terminal_id</code> 放在 HTTPProxy 相关链路中，应在本次实现内一并收敛或至少明确不再承担 trust 语义：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":168},{"after":168,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-first\" start=\"1\"><li><code>apps/http-proxy/src/index.ts</code>\n<ul><li>当前把 <code>terminal.terminal_id</code> 注入服务 <code>labels.terminal_id</code>。</li><li>处置建议：删除该标签；保留 <code>hostname</code> 作为观测即可。</li></ul></li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":169},{"after":169,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block\" start=\"2\"><li><code>apps/vendor-binance/src/api/client.ts</code>\n<ul><li>当前消费 helper 返回的 <code>terminalId</code>，并把它写入请求 <code>labels.terminal_id</code>。</li><li>处置建议：删除 <code>terminalId</code> 字段与对应标签，只按 <code>labels.ip</code> 路由。</li></ul></li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":170},{"after":170,"cjk":true,"html":"<ol class=\"li-block li-last\" start=\"3\"><li><code>libraries/http-services/src/proxy-ip.ts</code>\n<ul><li>当前以 allowlist 和返回值形式把 <code>terminal_id</code> 用作候选准入与稳定身份。</li><li>处置建议：本次直接删除；后续 <code>terminal_id</code> 仅允许用于日志、指标、缓存命名空间，不得进入 trust decision。</li></ul></li></ol>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":171},{"after":171,"cjk":true,"html":"<p>以下位置也出现 <code>terminal_id</code>，但本次判断不属于“trust boundary/稳定身份”问题，可暂不改：</p>","kind":"paragraph","op":"insert","slot":172},{"after":172,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li><code>libraries/http-services/src/proxy-ip.ts</code> 中以 <code>terminal.terminal_id</code> 区分本地缓存命名空间或日志上下文；这类用途不参与授权与路由，可保留。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":173},{"after":173,"cjk":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li>协议层 <code>libraries/protocol/*</code> 中的 <code>terminal_id</code> 仍是消息寻址字段，不在本 RFC 调整范围。</li></ul>","kind":"listItem","op":"insert","slot":174}],"reset":true,"rewrite":false,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"RFC: Proxy IP TokenBucket v2（去除 terminal_id 信任边界）","toc":[{"anchor":"rfc-proxy-ip-tokenbucket-v2去除-terminal_id-信任边界","level":1,"slot":1,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"RFC: Proxy IP TokenBucket v2（去除 terminal_id 信任边界）"},{"anchor":"摘要--动机","level":2,"slot":3,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"摘要 / 动机"},{"anchor":"目标与非目标","level":2,"slot":10,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"目标与非目标"},{"anchor":"目标","level":3,"slot":11,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"目标"},{"anchor":"非目标","level":3,"slot":20,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"非目标"},{"anchor":"定义","level":2,"slot":25,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"定义"},{"anchor":"现状与问题","level":2,"slot":32,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"现状与问题"},{"anchor":"拟议设计","level":2,"slot":38,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"拟议设计"},{"anchor":"1-信任模型","level":3,"slot":39,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"1. 信任模型"},{"anchor":"2-候选池与去重","level":3,"slot":44,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"2. 候选池与去重"},{"anchor":"3-调度与请求流程","level":3,"slot":54,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"3. 调度与请求流程"},{"anchor":"4-接口收敛","level":3,"slot":62,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"4. 接口收敛"},{"anchor":"5-appshttp-proxy-标签契约","level":3,"slot":71,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"5. apps/http-proxy 标签契约"},{"anchor":"6-关于同-ip-多-terminal-的行为","level":3,"slot":75,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"6. 关于同 IP 多 terminal 的行为"},{"anchor":"备选方案","level":2,"slot":79,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"备选方案"},{"anchor":"方案-a继续保留-trusted_http_proxy_terminal_ids","level":3,"slot":80,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"方案 A：继续保留 TRUSTED_HTTP_PROXY_TERMINAL_IDS"},{"anchor":"方案-b改用-terminal_id--ip-双因子","level":3,"slot":82,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"方案 B：改用 terminal_id + ip 双因子"},{"anchor":"方案-c引入-host-级显式信任域配置","level":3,"slot":84,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"方案 C：引入 host 级显式信任域配置"},{"anchor":"数据模型与接口","level":2,"slot":87,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"数据模型与接口"},{"anchor":"acquireproxybucketinput","level":3,"slot":88,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"AcquireProxyBucketInput"},{"anchor":"acquireproxybucketresult","level":3,"slot":94,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"AcquireProxyBucketResult"},{"anchor":"appshttp-proxy-服务标签","level":3,"slot":100,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"apps/http-proxy 服务标签"},{"anchor":"错误语义","level":2,"slot":104,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"错误语义"},{"anchor":"安全考虑","level":2,"slot":109,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"安全考虑"},{"anchor":"结论","level":3,"slot":110,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"结论"},{"anchor":"向后兼容发布与回滚","level":2,"slot":122,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"向后兼容、发布与回滚"},{"anchor":"向后兼容","level":3,"slot":123,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"向后兼容"},{"anchor":"发布步骤","level":3,"slot":127,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"发布步骤"},{"anchor":"回滚策略","level":3,"slot":131,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"回滚策略"},{"anchor":"验证计划","level":2,"slot":134,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"验证计划"},{"anchor":"开放问题","level":2,"slot":148,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"开放问题"},{"anchor":"落地计划","level":2,"slot":151,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"落地计划"},{"anchor":"文件变更点","level":3,"slot":152,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"文件变更点"},{"anchor":"最小验证步骤","level":3,"slot":162,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"最小验证步骤"},{"anchor":"发现的类似-terminal_id-依赖与处置建议","level":2,"slot":167,"tasks":{"done":0,"total":0},"title":"发现的类似 terminal_id 依赖与处置建议"}],"version":1}